[ The exemption below follows the longstanding GIMP project's reading of
  GPL section 2 (mere aggregation vs. combined work). Clay adopts the same
  position for programs that use libclay or the PDB protocol. ]

* If your program calls (or implements) PDB methods in the GPL-licensed Clay
  core through libclay or a compatible PDB implementation, that use is a
  mere aggregation with Clay as per GPL section 2; your program does not
  automatically become GPL merely by linking to or calling libclay.

